    "show_share": true,
    "description": "CIME collaborated with the Sanofi Pakistan to arrange a training of trainers programme for 20 pulmonologists and internal medicine specialists from all over Pakistan. The Programme subjected towards updates in the management of community-acquired pneumonia, ventilator-acquired pneumonia, hospital-acquired pneumonia, diseases mimicking pneumonia.",
